    "status" : "generated",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ta-workflow</b></p><a name=\"ta-workflow\"> </a><a name=\"hcta-workflow\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir.twiin.nl/ig/workflow/CodeSystem/ta-workflow</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">request-fulfillment<a name=\"ta-workflow-request-fulfillment\"> </a></td><td>Request fulfillment</td><td>The Multiple Fulfillers Pattern applies and no candidate has been selected yet; the owner is invited to accept and, optionally, to bid, and may not yet start the work.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">selected<a name=\"ta-workflow-selected\"> </a></td><td>Selected</td><td>The Placer has selected the owner of this Task as the Fulfiller.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">awaiting-information<a name=\"ta-workflow-awaiting-information\"> </a></td><td>Awaiting information</td><td>The Fulfiller needs more information from the Placer to continue or to decide.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">visit-scheduled<a name=\"ta-workflow-visit-scheduled\"> </a></td><td>Visit scheduled</td><td>A visit with the patient is scheduled.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">not-selected<a name=\"ta-workflow-not-selected\"> </a></td><td>Not selected</td><td>The Placer has selected another candidate; the Coordination Task of this candidate is cancelled.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">type-of-work<a name=\"ta-workflow-type-of-work\"> </a></td><td>Type of work</td><td>The entry carries the type of work.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">available-resource<a name=\"ta-workflow-available-resource\"> </a></td><td>Available resource</td><td>The entry refers, in valueReference, to one resource at the Placer that the Placer makes available to the Fulfiller.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">available-query<a name=\"ta-workflow-available-query\"> </a></td><td>Available query</td><td>The entry carries, in valueString, a search relative to the FHIR base of the Placer that the Placer makes available to the Fulfiller.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">information-request<a name=\"ta-workflow-information-request\"> </a></td><td>Information request</td><td>The entry carries, in the entry itself, a request from the Fulfiller for information it needs from the Placer.</td></tr></table></div>"
